NAME
    mv - move or rename files

SYNOPSIS
    mv src dst
    mv glob dir

DESCRIPTION
    Moves or renames a file. P8XFS has no rename primitive, so mv copies
    src to dst and then deletes src (the data is rewritten and the old
    extent is reclaimed later by pack). A glob source moves each match
    into the destination directory. `mv X X` is refused. mv is a /bin
    program.

EXAMPLES
    mv OLD.TXT NEW.TXT       rename in place
    mv *.tmp trash           move each match into a directory

SEE ALSO
    cp, del, pack
